ll_account` line), set by `link_stripe_subscription` and payment-link completion. Admin routes: `/api/v1/admin/customers/{id}/call-charges` (list, void, credit, retry, manual add, `{charge_id}/resolve` for a contested one), `/admin/customers/{id}/call-pricing`, `/admin/icps/{id}/call-price`, `/admin/call-pricing/quote`, `/admin/call-pricing/icps`; payment links, `POST /admin/customers/{id}/subscription/create` and onboarding `billing_options` take `product = "pay_per_call"`. Stripe objects: `scripts/stripe_setup_pay_per_call.py`.
